    "content": "<p>Jump into the first update of War Robots: Frontiers in Early Access!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This video will give you the lowdown on the first update, including quality-of-life improvements, new Robots, weapons, and abilities from Zukata, the Creative Director of War Robots: Frontiers.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With the holiday season upon us, we want to thank everyone for joining the fray in Early Access of War Robots: Frontiers. Happy Holidays, and we wish you the best for the New Year!</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mANjgz7ZnRE\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"349\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/mANjgz7ZnRE?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=0yuxb\" width=\"425\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Subscribe to our <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube channel</a> and stay tuned for more War Robots: Frontiers videos!&nbsp;</p>",
